[b]v0.1.1:[/b]
[h1]Flavorium Universalis - UI Fixes - French, German and Spanish[/h1]

[i]Compatible with EU5 1.3.* | Requires: Flavorium Universalis[/i]

[hr][/hr]

[h2]New: French, German and Spanish localization[/h2]

The toggle labels added by this submod are now translated into French, German and Spanish, matching the languages added to the base mod in v0.3.10.

[list]
[*] [b]Machine translated:[/b] produced with a local language model and validated automatically, not reviewed by a native speaker.
[*] [b]No gameplay changes:[/b] this release adds localization files only.
[/list]

[b]v0.1.0:[/b]
[h1]Flavorium Universalis — UI Fixes[/h1]

[hr][/hr]

[h3]Collapsible Cabinet Action Descriptions[/h3]
Added a toggle button to the cabinet interaction panel to show/hide action modifier and effect descriptions. Hidden by default; state persists per-country across panel openings and save/load.

[h3]Scrollable Age Event Advances[/h3]
Per-branch advance lists in the age event window are now in a fixed-height scrollable area with a vertical scrollbar, so long lists no longer overflow the window or push the branch-selection button off-screen.
